<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/AFLK> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/AFLK-AFLK_CRED> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/AFLK> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/AFLK-AFLK_DEV-type> .
