<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/APSV-APSV_AAV-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "APSV_AAV: value is not in the suggested format 0DP (0 decimal places). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/APSV-APSV_AAV-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/APSV_AAV> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/APSV-APSV_AAV-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[+-]?[0-9]+$" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/APSV-APSV_AAV-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
