<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CHOC-SAMP_TOP-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "SAMP_TOP: value is not in the suggested format 2DP (2 decimal places). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CHOC-SAMP_TOP-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/SAMP_TOP> .
