<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CHOC-SAMP_TYPE-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "SAMP_TYPE: value is not of the suggested type PA (text). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
