<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTM-CPTM_BASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CPTM_BASE: value is not in the suggested format 2DP (2 decimal places). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTM-CPTM_BASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/CPTM_BASE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTM-CPTM_BASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[+-]?[0-9]+\\.[0-9]{2}$" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTM-CPTM_BASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTM-CPTM_BASE-type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTM-CPTM_BASE-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CPTM_BASE: value is not of the suggested type 2DP (a number). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
