<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTZ-CPTZ_CD-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CPTZ_CD: value is not in the suggested format 4DP (4 decimal places). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
