<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRC-SAMP_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "SAMP_TYPE: value is not a standard AGS 4.2.0 abbreviation for SAMP_TYPE. Non-standard values must be defined in the file (Rule 16)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRC-SAMP_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/SAMP_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRC-SAMP_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(CONCB|CONCC|SPTLS|AMAL|COMP|BLK|CBR|MOS|ES|EW|LB|TW|UT|B|C|D|G|L|M|P|U|W)(\\+(CONCB|CONCC|SPTLS|AMAL|COMP|BLK|CBR|MOS|ES|EW|LB|TW|UT|B|C|D|G|L|M|P|U|W))*$" .
