<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRP-SAMP_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(CONCB|CONCC|SPTLS|AMAL|COMP|BLK|CBR|MOS|ES|EW|LB|TW|UT|B|C|D|G|L|M|P|U|W)(\\+(CONCB|CONCC|SPTLS|AMAL|COMP|BLK|CBR|MOS|ES|EW|LB|TW|UT|B|C|D|G|L|M|P|U|W))*$" .
