<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DMDT-LOCA_ID> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/LOCA_ID> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DMDT-LOCA_ID> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dataType> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/data-types/ID> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DMDT-LOCA_ID> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dictionaryEntry> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/LOCA_ID> .
