<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DMTZ-LOCA_ID> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DMTZ-LOCA_ID> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "327-16A" .
