<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DPRB-DPRB_DEL-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "DPRB_DEL: value is not in the suggested format T (elapsed time, e.g. hh:mm:ss). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
