<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DREM-LOCA_ID> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dictionaryEntry> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/LOCA_ID> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DREM-LOCA_ID> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/headingStatus> "*" .
