<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/ECTN-SAMP_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dataType> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/data-types/PA> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/ECTN-SAMP_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dictionaryEntry> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/SAMP_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/ECTN-SAMP_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/headingStatus> "*" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/ECTN-SAMP_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/isKey> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
