<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/HDPH-HDPH_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "HDPH_TYPE: value is not a standard AGS 4.2.0 abbreviation for HDPH_TYPE. Non-standard values must be defined in the file (Rule 16)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/HDPH-HDPH_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/HDPH_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/HDPH-HDPH_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(GCOP|ICBR|IDEN|INST|IRDX|IRES|ISPT|IVAN|TRAV|ABS|DCP|EXP|PPR|RCG|RPC|SCP|SNC|WLS|CC|CH|CP|DP|DS|HA|IJ|IP|OP|PC|PM|RC|RO|SH|TP|VC|VE|WS|W)(\\+(GCOP|ICBR|IDEN|INST|IRDX|IRES|ISPT|IVAN|TRAV|ABS|DCP|EXP|PPR|RCG|RPC|SCP|SNC|WLS|CC|CH|CP|DP|DS|HA|IJ|IP|OP|PC|PM|RC|RO|SH|TP|VC|VE|WS|W))*$" .
