<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/HDPH-HDPH_TYPE> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/HDPH_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/HDPH-HDPH_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/abbreviationList> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/abbreviations/HDPH_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/HDPH-HDPH_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dataType> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/data-types/PA> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/HDPH-HDPH_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dictionaryEntry> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/HDPH_TYPE> .
