<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/ISAT-ISAT_TIME-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(P.+|[0-9]+(:[0-5][0-9]){1,2}(\\.[0-9]+)?)$" .
