<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/LDEN-LDEN_COND-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "LDEN_COND: value is not a standard AGS 4.2.0 abbreviation for LDEN_COND. Non-standard values must be defined in the file (Rule 16)." .
