<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/MONS-MONS_TYPE> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/MONS-MONS_TYPE> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#order> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/MONS-MONS_TYPE> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/MONS_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/MONS-MONS_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/abbreviationList> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/abbreviations/MONS_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/MONS-MONS_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dataType> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/data-types/PA> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/MONS-MONS_TYPE> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dictionaryEntry> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/MONS_TYPE> .
