<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PIPE-key-null> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Another PIPE record has the same combination of KEY fields (LOCA_ID, PIPE_REF, PIPE_TOP, PIPE_BASE): {?xother} (Rule 10a)" .
