<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PLTT-PLTT_TIME-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "PLTT_TIME: value is not in the suggested format 1DP (1 decimal place). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
