<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key-null> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key-null> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Another PROJ record has the same combination of KEY fields (PROJ_ID): {?xother} (Rule 10a)" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key-null> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key-null> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "SELECT $this ?xother WHERE {\n    { FILTER (NOT EXISTS { $this ags:PROJ_ID ?n0 }) }\n    ?xother a ags:PROJ .\n    FILTER (?xother != $this)\n    OPTIONAL { $this ags:PROJ_ID ?a0 } OPTIONAL { ?xother ags:PROJ_ID ?b0 }\n    FILTER (COALESCE(STR(?a0), \"\") = COALESCE(STR(?b0), \"\"))\n}" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Another PROJ record has the same combination of KEY fields (PROJ_ID): {?xother} (Rule 10a)" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-key> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "SELECT $this ?xother WHERE {\n    $this ags:PROJ_ID ?v0 .\n    ?xother ags:PROJ_ID ?v0 .\n    FILTER (?xother != $this)\n    FILTER EXISTS { ?xother a ags:PROJ }\n}" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-single-row> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PROJ-single-row> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A data file shall contain only one PROJ data row (Rule 13)" .
