<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PUMT-PUMT_REM> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "PUMT_REM" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PUMT-PUMT_REM> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
