<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RCAG-TEST_STAT-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RCAG-TEST_STAT-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "TEST_STAT: value is not of the suggested type X (text). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
