<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RESP-SPEC_REF> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#order> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RESP-SPEC_REF> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/SPEC_REF> .
