<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREM-TREM_REM> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "TREM_REM" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREM-TREM_REM> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREM-TREM_REM> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#order> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREM-TREM_REM> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/TREM_REM> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREM-TREM_REM> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dataType> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/data-types/X> .
